{{DISPLAYTITLE:Pet System}}
__TOC__

Pets are a major progression system with type-based bonuses.

== Pet Types ==
* Worker
* Fisher
* Gambler
* Event

Only '''one active pet''' can be equipped at a time.

== Commands ==
* <code>/pets</code>
* <code>/pet equip pet_instance_id:&lt;id&gt;</code>
* <code>/pet keep pet_instance_id:&lt;id&gt;</code>
* <code>/pet shard pet_instance_id:&lt;id&gt;</code>
* <code>/pet sell pet_instance_id:&lt;id&gt;</code>
* <code>/pet rarities</code>
* <code>/shards</code>
* <code>/forge mythic_egg</code>

