== Duplicates, Shards, and Sell ==
Duplicate outcomes support:
* Keep
* Shard
* Sell

Shard values:
* Common 1 (duplicate common flow can resolve as 0.5 shard increments)
* Rare 3
* Epic 10
* Legendary 30
* Mythic 100

Sell values:
* Common 50
* Rare 150
* Epic 600
* Legendary 2500
* Mythic 10000

